.TH ZCTL 1 "31 August 2026" "ZoneCTL 4.10.1" "System Administration"
.SH NAME
zctl \- transactional DNS management toolkit for BIND 9
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zctl
.RI [ options ]
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zctl
provides guarded CLI and TUI workflows for DNS zones, records, lifecycle
operations and DNSSEC management. Mutating operations default to dry-run and
require explicit confirmation before changing BIND configuration.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B tui
Start the terminal user interface.
.TP
.B zone
Plan and execute zone lifecycle operations.
.TP
.B dnssec
Report, enable, verify and safely withdraw DNSSEC.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /etc/bind
BIND configuration inspected or modified by explicitly committed operations.
.TP
.I /var/lib/zonectl
ZoneCTL state, disabled zones and quarantine data.
.TP
.I /var/backups/zonectl-*
Transactional backups and manifests.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR named (8),
.BR rndc (8),
.BR named-checkconf (8),
.BR named-checkzone (8),
.BR dig (1)
